## Troubleshooting

### Extension Not Loading

- Check manifest.json syntax
- Verify all file paths in manifest are correct
- Check browser console for errors
- Try reloading extension

### Classification Not Working

- Test classifier independently: `cd packages/core && pnpm test`
- Check browser console logs in service worker
- Verify storage permissions are granted

### Build Failures

- Clear build artifacts: `pnpm -r clean`
- Delete node_modules: `rm -rf node_modules && pnpm install`
- Check TypeScript version compatibility

## Contributing Guidelines

1. Work in feature branches
2. Write tests for new classification patterns
3. Test manually in browser before committing
4. Update this documentation for architectural changes
5. Keep core package framework-agnostic (no browser APIs)

## Notes

- Don't start development servers automatically - check if running first
- This is a client-side only extension, no backend/API required
- All classification happens locally for privacy and speed
- User preferences stored in browser's local storage (not synced by default)
